Sun Jul 26 00:00:00 UTC 2026 - rodrigo@w3ti.com.br

- Fix a crash on saving a host or on external ~/.ssh/config changes,
  and fix the session tab not showing after connecting.
- Add a green/red connection status indicator next to each host in
  the sidebar, with a "Conectar"/"Desconectar" menu entry that closes
  the tab on disconnect and no longer opens a duplicate session for a
  host that's already connected.
- Embed the application and symbolic icons in the binary via a
  compiled GResource.

